<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor's next news briefing set for Feb 19.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor's next news briefing set for Feb 19.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) governor Yasuo Matsushita's next regular news conference will be on February 19, the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>Matsushita will deliver speeches at private meetings with business executives on February 4 and 28, it said.</p>
